      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/839c29/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-02T02:28:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Not sure yet we will see. Plan to check it out though if I can. Make sure to know where you are going to watch it though and be ready for those areas to be insane. My town is on the path and they are predicting the town to quadruple in size for the eclipse. This will be a large logistic nightmare.&nbsp;</p>",
